[AgentBox: rebased from vhost-user-backend-v0.20.0 onto v0.22.0. v0.22
 standardised SHMEM_MAP/SHMEM_UNMAP (backend messages 9 and 10, with
 VhostUserMMap) and GET_SHMEM_CONFIG (44), which crosvm doesn't speak.
 Those are kept unchanged; crosvm's messages 1000 and 1001 are added
 beside them as CROSVM_SHMEM_MAP and CROSVM_SHMEM_UNMAP, handled by new
 crosvm_shmem_map/crosvm_shmem_unmap methods, and only they always get a
 reply.]
